      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEVER GOING BACK (3) is a promising type who notched his 2nd career success when too good (30.05) at this track last time. Ideally placed to take this out. CANYA LET LOOSE (2) was a Grade 6 winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 2 this time where he has performed well. Has the ability and expected to do much better. GO WHISKEY GO (4) missed the frame last time when fourth (16.78) at Q Straight but prior to that had two placings in a row. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Has ability and is one of the better chances. BLACK RASPBERRY (7) was beaten into fourth last time but ran impressive time with a slick 19.81. Worth thought on that run.",
